"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p022:m0114","start":114,"end":116,"surface":"文曠","kind":"person","person_id":"nm5_vv3_lb0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p022:m0126","start":126,"end":128,"surface":"慧景","kind":"person","person_id":"tvq_7my_nqh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete:p022:m0131","start":131,"end":133,"surface":"恭祖","kind":"person","person_id":"jdk_9jk_otv","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-051","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-051-pei-cui-zhang-complete-ws1504716"},{"id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p005","text":"東昏失德，江祏欲立江夏王寶玄，末更回惑，與弟祀密謂朓曰：「江夏年少，脫不堪，不可復行廢立。始安年長入纂，不乖物望。非以此要富貴，只求安國家爾。」遙光又遣親人劉渢致意於朓。朓自以受恩明帝，不肯答。少日，遙光以朓兼知衛尉事，朓懼見引，即以祏等謀告左興盛，又說劉暄曰：「始安一旦南面，則劉渢、劉晏居卿今地，但以卿爲反復人爾。」暄陽驚，馳告始安王及江祏。始安欲出朓爲東陽郡，祏固執不與。先是，朓常輕祏爲人，祏常詣朓，朓因言有一詩，呼左右取，旣而便停。祏問其故，云：「定復不急」。祏以爲輕己。後祏及弟祀、劉渢、劉晏俱候朓，朓謂祏曰：「可謂帶二江之雙流」，以嘲弄之。祏轉不堪，至是構而害之。詔暴其過惡，收付廷尉。又使御史中丞範岫奏收朓，下獄死，時年三十六。臨終謂門賓曰：「寄語沈公，君方爲三代史，亦不得見沒。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":5,"end":7,"surface":"江祏","id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p005:m0005","person_id":"q63_4br_3of_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作江祏。"},{"start":12,"end":14,"surface":"寶玄","id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p005:m0012","person_id":"w4m_9tw_147_B","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作蕭寶玄。"},{"start":22,"end":23,"surface":"祀","id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p005:m0022","person_id":"q63_4br_3of_B","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作江祀。"},{"start":25,"end":26,"surface":"朓","id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p005:m0025","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABCBA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝朓。"},{"start":72,"end":74,"surface":"遙光","id":"c-nansh